# Parent UI

- Chat left, live iframe right on desktop; stack on small screens
- Subscribe to SSE `/sessions/:id/events` — no polling
- Set iframe `src` to sandbox `previewUrl` only
- On `preview.ready` / `editor.completed`, refresh iframe without a full page reload
- Smart Match: show Use existing vs Build new; do not auto-accept
